<title>CHINA: China's Legend computers eye securities market.</title>
<headline>China's Legend computers eye securities market.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Legend Group has signed up Eagle Computer Network Ltd as its agent in the domestic securities market, an Eagle official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We plan to sell 10,000 Legend computers in one year,&quot; the official said by telephone from the southern boomtown of Shenzhen.</p>
<p>Eagle has sold 1,000 Legend computers to its parent company, China Eagle Securities Co in Shenzhen, he said without giving further details.</p>
<p>The Legend Group includes Legend Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
